> The Gubernatorial Candidate of the All Progressives Congress (APC) in Akwa Ibom State, Obong[ N]s[ima E]ke[re,] has promised to rehabilitate victims of the violence that ravaged Ukanafun Local Government Area in the last three years[ when] he[ becomes] Governor[ on May 29, 2019.]
