]Addressing the APC campaign rally at Ikot Akpa Nkuk[,] the Ukanafun Local Government Headquarters[ on Friday, E]ke[re] also promised to grant proper amnesty to the repentant militants and not the fake amnesty[ of] the present State[ Government.
